<p>Recommendations reflect Enteriors' factory-build and installation experience across Bangalore and Hosur kitchens, including post-handover service visits — which is where accessory choices prove themselves or don't. Prices are indicative 2026 Bangalore market rates across budget and premium hardware tiers and vary with brand, series, load rating, and cabinet dimensions.</p>
